  "summary_en": "European Commission report accompanying the 2020 AI White Paper, assessing gaps in EU product safety and liability frameworks for AI, IoT and robotics. It finds existing law largely adequate but recommends targeted adaptations: cybersecurity, human oversight, re-assessment of self-learning products, software, and revised Product Liability Directive and burden-of-proof rules, with risk-based strict liability.",
